Ultimately, the best way to make dye out of mixed Hypogymnia lichen depends on your specific requirements and preferences. If you're looking for a quick and easy way to create a bright and vibrant dye, the boiling water method might be the go-to option. But if you want a more complex and nuanced dye that will last longer, consider using an ammonia fermentation process.

